const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"先定义什么叫预测得好",en:"Define what a good forecast means"},body:{zh:"Diebold与Mariano允许损失函数不局限于平方误差，也不要求对正负误差对称。比较必须先确定预测对象、评价日期与损失含义。用绝对误差和平方误差得到不同排序并不矛盾，它们对大误差的权重本来就不同。",en:"Diebold and Mariano allow losses beyond squared error, including asymmetric losses. The forecast target, evaluation dates and meaning of loss must be specified first. Rankings under absolute and squared error can differ because they weight large mistakes differently."},reference:{url:"https://www.ssc.wisc.edu/~bhansen/718/DieboldMariano1995.pdf",label:{zh:"1995年期刊版 · p. 254",en:"1995 journal article · p. 254"}}},{title:{zh:"检验对象是逐期损失差",en:"The object is a sequence of loss differences"},body:{zh:"每个日期先计算两个预测的损失，再相减形成损失差序列。原假设是这个序列的总体均值为零，不是两个模型系数相同，也不是每一天都表现相同。损失相减的方向决定统计量正负，解释时必须与定义一致。",en:"For each date, subtract one forecast's loss from the other's. The null concerns a zero population mean of that difference, not identical model coefficients or identical performance every day. The subtraction convention determines the statistic's sign and interpretation."},reference:{url:"https://www.ssc.wisc.edu/~bhansen/718/DieboldMariano1995.pdf",label:{zh:"1995年期刊版 · p. 254 · §1.1",en:"1995 journal article · p. 254 · §1.1"}}},{title:{zh:"平均差的误差要考虑时间相关",en:"Uncertainty in the average must account for dependence"},body:{zh:"即使两种预测针对同一目标，其误差也可能同期相关，损失差还可能跨期相关。论文用包含自协方差的长期方差刻画平均损失差的不确定性。直接把逐期差值当作独立样本，可能低估或误估检验所需的标准误。",en:"Forecast errors can be contemporaneously correlated, and their loss differences can also be serially dependent. The long-run variance includes autocovariances when measuring uncertainty in the mean difference. Treating every date as independent can misstate the standard error."},reference:{url:"https://www.ssc.wisc.edu/~bhansen/718/DieboldMariano1995.pdf",label:{zh:"1995年期刊版 · §1.1",en:"1995 journal article · §1.1"}}},{title:{zh:"预测期限不自动决定正确带宽",en:"The horizon does not automatically determine a valid bandwidth"},body:{zh:"原文把k步最优预测误差至多具有k减一阶依赖作为有用基准，同时提醒实际应用可能违背它。核函数和截断滞后影响长期方差估计。不能仅凭预测期限就无条件截断所有相关，尤其当模型误设或信息更新不规则时。",en:"The paper treats dependence through k minus one lags for optimal k-step errors as a useful benchmark, not a universal fact. Kernel and truncation choices affect long-run variance estimation. Misspecification or irregular information updates can invalidate a purely horizon-based choice."},reference:{url:"https://www.ssc.wisc.edu/~bhansen/718/DieboldMariano1995.pdf",label:{zh:"1995年期刊版 · §1.1 · p. 254",en:"1995 journal article · §1.1 · p. 254"}}},{title:{zh:"符号检验的零假设略有不同",en:"The sign test has a different null"},body:{zh:"论文也讨论符号和符号秩检验，其中符号检验针对损失差的中位数为零。中位数差与均值差并非通常相同，甚至损失差的中位数也不等于两个损失中位数之差。只有增加相应分布条件，才能把这些检验解释为同一个问题。",en:"The sign test concerns the median of the loss difference, not generally its mean or the difference between two medians. The paper discusses conditions such as symmetry that connect these interpretations. Choosing another test can therefore change the question being answered."},reference:{url:"https://www.ssc.wisc.edu/~bhansen/718/DieboldMariano1995.pdf",label:{zh:"1995年期刊版 · §1.2–1.3",en:"1995 journal article · §1.2–1.3"}}},{title:{zh:"一次比较不能证明普遍优越",en:"One comparison does not establish universal superiority"},body:{zh:"渐近检验需要损失差满足平稳和短记忆等条件，有限样本检验也各有前提。编辑解读：一个评价窗口中的拒绝，只支持该样本设计与损失下的差异；未拒绝可能是证据不足，反复尝试很多预测后挑选赢家还引入另一个选择问题。",en:"The asymptotic result needs stationary, short-memory loss differences; finite-sample alternatives have their own assumptions. Editorial interpretation: rejection concerns the specified evaluation design. Non-rejection may reflect limited evidence, while selecting a winner after many trials creates another problem."},reference:{url:"https://www.ssc.wisc.edu/~bhansen/718/DieboldMariano1995.pdf",label:{zh:"1995年期刊版 · §1.1–1.3",en:"1995 journal article · §1.1–1.3"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"检验针对两个预测序列在指定损失函数下的平均表现。未拒绝不等于等效，单次比较也不校正反复筛选；损失差的平稳性与相关结构仍需成立。",en:"The test compares two forecast sequences under a specified loss. Non-rejection is not equivalence, and one comparison does not correct repeated selection. Assumptions on loss-difference stationarity and dependence still apply."}};export{e as default};
